SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mg/L
    Ba 2.0
    S(6) 15.0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    25 95 in 5 steps

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -temperature true
    -step true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings SpCond_uS_cm
    10 PUNCH SC
END
